  "prefLabel": "En 1018.12 Voluntary Disconnection",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1018.12 Voluntary Disconnection. The interconnecting customer may disconnect the facility at any time without prior notice to the utility and may terminate the IA at any time with 10 days notice to the utility.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
